WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Hello, my name is Tim Lauré. I am the pastor of Open Church in Lommel, Belgium.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Thank you for taking a moment to watch this video and for your interest in our new building project.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
I am really glad you are watching, and I would like to show you in the next few moments what we are working on.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Open Church is a Protestant-Evangelical church. We have been around since the 1980s.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
But since 2004, we have been blessed to purchase a beautiful building here in Lommel, which is in the Belgian Kempen.

6
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.000
You can see it here on my right side.

7
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Over the years, Open Church has steadily grown.

8
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:43.000
And ultimately, from 2012 to 2014, we were able to build this beautiful building.

9
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:51.000
But due to the good work we are able to do in the name of Jesus and the stable growth of Open Church, we are now happily compelled to build a new building.

10
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:56.000
What we are going to do now is split this new building project into several phases.

11
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Phase 1 is that we will first build a children's and youth church.

12
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:06.000
Phase 2 is that we will demolish the old building so that we can build a completely new hall there.

13
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:10.000
We are grateful to God the Father for the wonderful things we see happening in Open Church.

14
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:14.000
The church is growing, people are coming to repentance, and more disciples of Jesus are joining us.

15
00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:18.000
And that leads us to this new building project.

16
00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:22.000
We have saved for this, the finances of Open Church are stable.

17
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:28.000
But that is why we also look forward with expectation and faith to how we can finance this overall project.

18
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:32.000
Thank you for watching this video and for your interest.

19
00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:37.000
The good work of the gospel in the south of the Netherlands and the north of Belgium must continue.

20
00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:39.000
And we are very happy about that.

21
00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Thank you.
